{"sections":[{"slug":"J-同态","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"J-同态"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“J-<span lang=\"zh\">同态</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“J-同态”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/环谱","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">环谱</span>"}},{"Plain":" $R$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $\\mathrm {GL}_1(R)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\Omega^{\\infty}R$ <span lang=\"zh\">中</span> $\\pi_0(R)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的可逆元对应的子空间</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $\\mathrm O=\\operatorname{colim}_n \\mathrm O(n)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为稳定正交群</span>.</p>\n<p>J-<span lang=\"zh\">同态是指</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/∞-群","text":"∞-<span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">之间的一个态射</span> $\\mathrm O \\to\\mathrm {GL}_1(\\mathbb S)$. <span lang=\"zh\">其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/逆环路空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">逆环路空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathrm {BO} \\to \\mathrm {BGL}_1(\\mathbb S)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是实向量丛到球丛的自然变换</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">将向量丛对应到其逐纤维一点紧化</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}